<title>GERMANY: Kaufring to report 96 profit, possible dividend.</title>
<headline>Kaufring to report 96 profit, possible dividend.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>German retailer Kaufring AG said on Wednesday it would report a profit in 1996 and said this would allow the payment of a dividend.</p>
<p>At the end of January, Kaufring reported a fall in sales to 2.9 billion marks in 1996 from 3.1 billion marks a year earlier, the group said in a mandatory statement.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
